  "notes": [
    "grain secret: the SLIP-0010 node m/44'/1010'/account'/3'/0'; a grain's key: Ed25519 from the seed BLAKE3-derive_key(\"Saltix grain key v1\", secret || slug)",
    "manifest: Borsh of GrainManifest; owner: AccountId [32]; owner_key: Ed25519 tag 0 [32] | P256 tag 1 [33] (SEC1 compressed); id = derive_key(\"Saltix grain manifest id v1\", borsh); the owner key signs m = derive_key(\"Saltix grain manifest v1\", borsh): Ed25519 over m, or ECDSA P-256 over SHA-256 of m as r || s with a low s",
    "managed: the owner is the kind 5 account of accounts-v1.json and the owner key its phone (phone_secret_hex there); P-256 signatures here are RFC 6979's, any valid low-s signature checks",
    "json: the form a hosted grain serves at /.well-known/saltix-grain; bytes in lowercase hex",
    "icon = derive_key(\"Saltix grain icon v1\", png); bundle = derive_key(\"Saltix grain bundle v1\", zip)",
    "login: the grain key signs derive_key(\"Saltix grain login v1\", Borsh(GrainLogin))",
    "invoice: the signer signs derive_key(\"Saltix grain invoice v1\", genesis_hash || Borsh(Invoice)); a certified key's InvoiceKeyCert is signed by the owner over derive_key(\"Saltix grain invoice key v1\", Borsh((slug, key, expires_at)))",
    "the payment's public memo: the reference in lowercase hex, a space, the invoice's text",
    "grain messaging key: X25519 secret derive_key(\"Saltix grain messaging key v1\", secret || slug); frames to a grain alias are base64url(nonce 24 || NaCl crypto_box) between messaging keys",
    "notification: the owner or the certified server key signs derive_key(\"Saltix grain notification v1\", genesis_hash || Borsh(GrainNotification)); SignedGrainNotification is Borsh {notification, cert: Option<InvoiceKeyCert>, signature}",
    "registry: Action::Registry is tag 1 {call, amount: u64}; the calls after ExchangeDebt (tag 6) are RegisterGrain tag 7 {manifest: SignedGrainManifest}, paid in SALT, at least GRAIN_DEPOSIT; UpdateGrain tag 8 {manifest}; RetireGrain tag 9 {slug: String}; the sender is the manifest's owner, and its owner_key speaks for it (13-accounts §5); ids as in transaction-v3.json"
  ],
